Dialogue: 3,0:22:41.05,0:22:51.39,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5\3c&HAC9E8B&\pos(140,940)\an1}難道全身都成了心
Dialogue: 3,0:22:51.39,0:22:56.86,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5\3c&HAC9E8B&\pos(1780,940)\an3}殘酷痛楚難以忍受
