Dialogue: 3,0:23:09.78,0:23:12.33,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}櫻花凋零  片片飛舞
Dialogue: 3,0:23:12.33,0:23:16.04,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}我永遠在苦苦等待
Dialogue: 3,0:23:16.04,0:23:19.09,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}渴望得到你的溫暖
Dialogue: 3,0:23:20.25,0:23:23.01,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}我最討厭流下眼淚
Dialogue: 3,0:23:23.01,0:23:26.26,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}生怕被人看出悲傷
Dialogue: 3,0:23:26.26,0:23:29.55,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}將它深深鎖在體內
Dialogue: 3,0:23:30.43,0:23:30.97,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HAC9E8B&\blur6\bord1.5}快了，
Dialogue: 3,0:23:30.97,0:23:33.18,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HAC9E8B&\blur6\bord1.5}櫻花凋零  片片飛舞
